--- !u!114 &8194037973328525635
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6627122057439592994}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7c99b7bc4f6a40b4c9eed12c76c6930a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _currentPhase: 0
  _nextButton: {fileID: 9066662214196682475}
  _tutorialText: {fileID: 1071939484}
  _tutorialSteps:
  - StepText: "Antes de comenzar, es esencial que conozcas los controles y las interacciones
      b\xE1sicas. Para empezar, apunta al boton continuar con uno de los mandos y
      cuando se encienda, toca el gatillo encendido"
    Action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    ConditionMet: 0
    Actual: 0
    Objective: 0
  - StepText: Para moverte, utiliza el joystick de uno de los mandos. Prueba a moverte
      hacia delante unos metros. Luego pero hacia detras.
    Action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 8194037973328525635}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Tutorial, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: Movement
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    ConditionMet: 0
    Actual: 0
    Objective: 1
  - StepText: 'Da vueltas por la clase pasando por todos los puntos rojos '
    Action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 8194037973328525635}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Tutorial, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: Destino
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    ConditionMet: 0
    Actual: 0
    Objective: 0
  - StepText: Hora de que tus alumnos te escuchen. Ordena al alumno a irse fuera
      de clase
    Action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 8194037973328525635}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Tutorial, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: Ordenes
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    ConditionMet: 0
    Actual: 0
    Objective: 4
  - StepText: Ahora, solo falta que entiendas los botones. Observa los mandos y pulsa
      los botones que se indican atendiendo a su funcionalidad
    Action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 8194037973328525635}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Tutorial, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: Botones
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    ConditionMet: 0
    Actual: 0
    Objective: 4
